<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Group Teleport</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 130)
Mana: 25, and about 10 more for each group member
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast group teleport &lt;someone, something or a place&gt;
</pre>
<p>Takes you and your whole group, everyone grouped with you who stands in the 
room, to a person, a creature, an object or a place anywhere in the world. 
Each member costs you about 10 mana more, a little less the stronger your 
spell; if you haven't enough mana for all of them, only you go.
</p><p>It can't take you out of a place magic can't leave, nor into one magic can't 
reach, and it won't set you down in water. And beware the rift: about one 
cast in twenty tears a hole in the powers of magic, and all your mana is gone.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
